===A6_S2_D2===
// cillian
Narrator: After agreeing to help fetch supplies from the Ichthyos settlement, Cillian pulls you to the side with congratulations.
Cillian: You seem a lot more sure of yourself today. #portrait:Cillian
Cillian: No matter what secrets you find, I’m sure the both of you will do something worthwhile. #portrait:Cillian
Noelle: Thanks, Cillian. #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Amelia: We just have to find this Ada person, right? Not Clara’s master, but an Ichthyos girl? #portrait:AmeliaSilly
Cillian: That’s correct. #portrait:Cillian
Cillian: Noah had a few bases around the beach and mountainside, so perhaps they’ll be able to give you more insight about his history. And the weather, too. #portrait:Cillian
Noelle: The weather? #portrait:NoelleShocked
Cillian: Yes. The Ichthyos and Krakenfolk not only patrol the waters to ensure the island’s safety, but there is also a way for them to read the weather based on the state of things. #portrait:Cillian
Amelia: Those in the mountains do a similar thing. Guess they need to be at a crazy high or low altitude for it, huh? #portrait:AmeliaHappy
Cillian: Some describe it as being at the tip or belly of the world. #portrait:Cillian
Cillian: Though of course, only beings like the Great Disaster would truly know what those ends look like. #portrait:Cillian
-> DONE